  values ((select id from public.learning_units where release_id = v_release_id and source_key = '47_Station_7.4_The_Complaint_and_the_Apology'), 'static-html', 'legacy_static_html', 0, jsonb_build_object('html', '

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="topbar">
      
      <span>The CASC Academy · by MedLex Foundations</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tagrow">
      <span class="tag prime">Station 7.4 &middot; Domain 7</span>
      <span class="tag">Difficult Conversations</span><span class="tag">The Professional Apology</span>
      <span class="tag">Duty of Candour</span><span class="tag">Complaints</span>
    </div>
    <h1>The Complaint and the Apology</h1>
    <p class="sub">Lorraine, 47, sits very upright with a folder squared on her knees, and she is not shouting. Eight months ago your clinic started her on olanzapine; nobody said one word about weight. Sixteen kilos later, her GP&rsquo;s nurse &mdash; not you &mdash; found the pre-diabetes, and nobody here had checked her bloods for seven months. It&rsquo;s all written down, dates and all, and PALS gave her the forms on the way in. Something genuinely went wrong, and the person opposite knows it. <b>Between &ldquo;I&rsquo;m sorry you feel that way&rdquo; and the grovel sits the professional apology: named, owned, and answered with change.</b></p>
    <div class="lens"><b>THE QUESTION BEHIND EVERY MARK</b>
      &ldquo;Would I be confident to have this candidate as my registrar?&rdquo; In this room it becomes the candour test: when the complaint is substantially right, does this doctor hear the account in full before a word of response? Is the apology aimed at deeds, not feelings &mdash; the fault named specifically, in active voice, with the actor still in the sentence? Is it owned clean, with no comma-but riding in behind it &mdash; and does it keep its edges, conceding everything true and nothing untrue? And then does it become candour rather than theatre: real change, with paperwork and dates &mdash; and her right to complain supported, not quietly purchased?</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="modebar"><div class="wrap">
  <span class="label">MODE</span>
  <div class="mtoggle">
    <button id="mLearn" class="active">Learn Mode</button>
    <button id="mExam">Exam Mode</button>
  </div>
  <span class="timer" id="timer">07:00</span>
